ue,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“为什么？你明明一直想要成为一名骑士。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"74":{"step":[[74,75,""]],"type":1,"name":["“罗兰”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"301801.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":true,"text":["“让那些古板的主教们同意让一位女士当骑士，这不是一件容易的事。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"75":{"step":[[75,76,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“您还记得我的父亲吗？”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"76":{"step":[[76,77,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“这些年，他不知从什么地方得知了我在布列塔尼，一直在写信催促我回去，好继续他那未完成的交易。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"77":{"step":[[77,78,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“他向我发出了最后的警告，如果我不按照他的想法去行动——”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"78":{"step":[[78,79,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“他会让一位名叫菲尔格特的巨人，‘请’我回去。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"79":{"step":[[79,80,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“您瞧瞧，他在这封信里把那个巨人写得多么可怕。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"80":{"step":[[80,81,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“15英尺高，浑身长满了癞疮与脓包。”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"81":{"step":[[81,82,""]],"type":1,"name":["“奥德”","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"303901.